jobResponsibilities:
The broad areas of responsibilities for the portfolio include the following:

• Engage and collaborate with the identified Sectoral Leads (MCCY, MSF, MOH, SSG, MTI, NRF and A*STAR) and Domain Leads (IRAS, CAD and GovTech) to develop/review and implement initiatives, frameworks and practices to improve grants management within each sector, as well as to build up capabilities;
• Staff the Grants Management Committee and coordinate efforts across domains, as well as monitor the overall implementation progress of initiatives to improve grants governance by the Sectoral and Domain Leads;
• Formulate and review policies to address emerging risks due to evolving grant landscapes and audit observations related to grants management;
• Collaborate with stakeholders to deploy technological solutions to enhance public sector agencies’ risk management efforts; and
• Undertake any other projects as assigned.

